ai "Ball Hawk"
about "Reads the quarterback and jumps routes. Picks or gets burned."
position CB
dials aggression 0.85 discipline 0.35 vision 0.75

rules:
  when before the throw and time over 1.2s and chance 45% -> jump the route
  when ball in air -> play the ball
  when carrier within 2 -> go for the strip
  otherwise -> follow assignment
